# Failures sending an image from the clipboard to a pane through the daemon.

error-client-clipboard-busy = 剪贴板图片上传已预留或正在进行
error-client-clipboard-cancelled = 剪贴板图片上传已取消
error-client-clipboard-input-target = 语义输入回退需要窗格或弹窗目标
error-client-clipboard-preparation-timeout = 剪贴板图片准备超时；已跳过预留
error-client-clipboard-write-timeout = 剪贴板图片写入超时；需要重新连接
